  <item>
    <title>Vol.01 开你X的滴滴:那些扫兴的瞬间</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6570130054f87fe00fb7ad65</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6570130054f87fe00fb7ad65</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 06 Dec 2023 06:21:51 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>我们设备升级了啊</span></p><span></span><p><span>但是我们葱哥声音有点中气不足</span></p><span></span><p><span>没办法，35了，这个年纪大家多担待吧</span></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>这一期算是正式的第一期</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><strong><span>本期想聊的是让人扫兴的瞬间</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>主题是饼干想的，结果本来想吐槽别人</span></p><span></span><p><span>结果自己才是那个“妈味儿”很重的扫兴之人</span></p><span></span><p><span>葱哥和老杨帮饼干重新反思了自己</span></p><span></span><p><span>哈哈哈哈哈哈</span></p><span></span><p><span>PS.<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="736">12:16</a> 老杨想说的是发际线挺高的，口误了</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【本期摘要】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="325">05:25</a> 面试官不好好面试，真扫兴！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="454">07:34</a> 简历放演出照片，就是帅</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="690">11:30</a> 和学长互相依靠，真扫兴！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="911">15:11</a> &nbsp;纯爱老杨，约女神就约图书馆，真扫兴！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1073">17:53</a> 纯爱老杨，赊账安慰女神，更扫兴！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1155">19:15</a> 饼干（河南）：家里对我当官的执念不亚于山东人，真扫兴！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1305">21:45</a> 葱哥：给女朋友过生日，真扫兴！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1471">24:31</a> 饼干绕不过去的滴滴，评评理，谁扫兴？！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2030">33:50</a> </span><strong><span>本期金句</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2130">35:30</a> 饼干幡然悔悟，真扫兴！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2336">38:56</a> 饼干“妈味儿”觉醒，真扫兴！</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期主播：</span></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>饼干：暴躁会计、耶笑即兴成员</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/60896d630000000001005c70?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=5cb1b13c000000001101926c&amp;apptime=1701842029" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/60896d630000000001005c70?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=5cb1b13c000000001101926c&amp;apptime=1701842029"><span>小红薯@脱口秀优秀观众饼饼干</span></a></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>令糊葱：非独立喜剧人 静安区男德推广大使</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5df707f70000000001002a77?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=5cb1b13c000000001101926c&amp;apptime=1701842131" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5df707f70000000001002a77?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=5cb1b13c000000001101926c&amp;apptime=1701842131"><span>小红薯@令糊葱</span></a></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>老杨：兼职单口喜剧演员 一上班就emo的新晋奶爸</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5cb1b13c000000001101926c?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=5cb1b13c000000001101926c&amp;apptime=1701842172" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5cb1b13c000000001101926c?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=5cb1b13c000000001101926c&amp;apptime=1701842172"><span>小红薯@还是叫老杨吧</span></a></p><span></span><p><strong><span>希望大家多多点评，多多关注！~</span></strong></p>]]></description>
