  <item>
    <title>Vol.00 直男请回答（试播）</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6568852a51ba7218576c1518</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6568852a51ba7218576c1518</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 30 Nov 2023 12:50:49 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>我们三个是第一次做播客</span></p><span></span><p><span>这一期算是试播</span></p><span></span><p><span>因为经验不足，设备简陋，音质特别不好</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们后续都会改进的</span></p><span></span><p><span>这期你们先凑合着听吧（音量开大点、仔细听）</span></p><span></span><p><span>就听一乐儿</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>本期聊的是一个拉拉对两个直男的访谈</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>本期主播：</span></p><span></span><p><span>饼干：幽默女会计，热爱种花、做饭和分享上当受骗经验</span></p><span></span><p><span>令糊葱：非独立喜剧人 静安区男德推广大使</span></p><span></span><p><span>老杨：兼职单口喜剧演员 一上班就emo的新晋奶爸</span></p><span></span><p><span>场外观众：</span></p><span></span><p><span>卷毛</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期摘要】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="120">02:00</a> 这就是直男</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="199">03:19</a> 男的容易升职加薪是因为会邀功</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="450">07:30</a> “普通且自信”挺好的&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="667">11:07</a> 小学为什么要互掏下体啊？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1065">17:45</a> 男生会有“雄竞”吗？&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1320">22:00</a> 我们不喜欢“绿茶婊”和“装逼”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1498">24:58</a> 我们还是不喜欢“装逼”&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1680">28:00</a> 35是黄金年龄</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1900">31:40</a> 这个社会对男人的规训就是做个人吧</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1990">33:10</a> 上厕所是男性红利&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2520">42:00</a> 葱哥对自己的要求就是想挣钱了</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/luN3AEbJSAPM1h5_8wonrZjCrZQv.m4a" length="63859181" type="audio/mp4"/>
